	SNA	CLA		/MATCH?
	JMP	SCAN06		/YES
	TAD I	INDEX6		/GET THE DELIMETER CODE
	SZA	CLA		/NULL?
	JMP	SCAN01		/NO - TRY NEXT
	TAD	DEL		/GET DELIMITER
	SNA	CLA		/ALREADY FOUND?
	JMP	SCAN02		/NO
	TAD	T4		/YES, HOLD THIS CHARACTER
	DCA	CHOLD
